      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0003-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0003-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0003-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0003-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0003-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0003-l0004"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0003-l0000",
      "p0004-n0003-l0001",
      "p0004-n0003-l0002",
      "p0004-n0003-l0003",
      "p0004-n0003-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "Despite modern design and tracking capabilities, airplanes such as Malaysian flight MH370 occasionally disappear over swathes of open ocean. With no communication from the downed plane, searchers must determine the optimal strategy for recovery. Meanwhile, family members of passengers wait anxiously for news of their loved ones\u2019 fates."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000043",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0004-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "The Dilemma:"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000044",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0005-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0005-l0001"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0005-l0000",
      "p0004-n0005-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf The primary objective is to find the missing plane."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000045",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0006-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0006-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0006-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0006-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0006-l0000",
      "p0004-n0006-l0001",
      "p0004-n0006-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf Our second consideration is to reduce the time it takes to find the plane and any surviving passengers, improving the odds of rescuing them alive."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000046",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0007-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0007-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0007-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0007-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0007-l0000",
      "p0004-n0007-l0001",
      "p0004-n0007-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf In addition, we will take into account the different types of downed planes, search planes, and sensors."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000047",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0008-l0000"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "The Approach:"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000048",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0009-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0009-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0009-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0009-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0009-l0000",
      "p0004-n0009-l0001",
      "p0004-n0009-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf First we examine historic plane crashes to build context\u2014their locations, causes, and the potential downed planes involved."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000049",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0010-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0010-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0010-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0010-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0010-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0010-l0003"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0010-l0000",
      "p0004-n0010-l0001",
      "p0004-n0010-l0002",
      "p0004-n0010-l0003"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf Taking into account various communication methods and FAA regulations, we determine what constitutes a plane \u201clost\u201d and the time it takes to reach that conclusion."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000050",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0011-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0011-l0001"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0011-l0000",
      "p0004-n0011-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf We learn about the origin and evolution of ocean search technique."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000051",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0012-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0012-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0012-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0012-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0012-l0000",
      "p0004-n0012-l0001",
      "p0004-n0012-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf We research various search planes and sensors to find their speed, sight, and accuracy."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000052",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0013-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0013-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0013-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0013-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0013-l0000",
      "p0004-n0013-l0001",
      "p0004-n0013-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf We define all the variables we will use throughout the development of our model."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000053",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0014-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0014-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0014-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0014-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0014-l0000",
      "p0004-n0014-l0001",
      "p0004-n0014-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf Using our chosen downed plane specifications, we calculate the maximum search area that we need to consider."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000054",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0015-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0015-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0004-n0015-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0004-n0015-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0015",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0004-n0015-l0000",
      "p0004-n0015-l0001",
      "p0004-n0015-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      4
    ],
    "text": "\u25cf Based on our crash research, we determine the probability distribution of downed planes within the search area."
  }
]
